@startuml
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

actor "User" as User
[Lobby Service] as Lobby
database "PostgreSQL\n(Lobby DB)" as LobbyDB
[Game Service] as Game
database "PostgreSQL\n(Game DB)" as GameDB
queue "Kafka\ntopic: party-started" as Kafka

User --> Lobby : REST API
User --> Game : REST API
Lobby -down-> LobbyDB : SQL
Game -down-> GameDB : SQL
Lobby --> Kafka : publish event
Kafka --> Game : consume event

@enduml
